Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.20,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fade(800,600)\shad3\blur1\fs60\c&HF1F1F1&}Episode 8 \N {\fs100} Eraser
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.00,Sign,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.17,0:00:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The weather is hot and humid today.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:23.26,0:00:24.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll draw something nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:36.15,0:00:40.86,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, \Nit was probably this weather that was to blame. {this is narrator, herself commenting from the future when it's already happened commenting on the past}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.86,0:00:46.06,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps it was the very existence \Nof the magic pencil that was to blame?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.87,0:00:51.40,Narrator,,0,0,0,,See? With it, I can bring anything to life!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:51.40,0:00:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's draw some foam. {she says 泡書いちゃおう}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.75,0:00:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... That's better. {she says 泡書いちゃおう}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.39,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the famous magic pencil! {?????} {音に聞いた means that it has a reputation to it, so surprisingly you're right}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.32,0:01:10.81,Narrator,,0,0,0,,See? Didn't I tell you{ to be more careful}? \NSee, the thief's peeping! {??????}{https://www.weblio.jp/content/言わんこっちゃない}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.07,0:01:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.74,0:01:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.05,0:01:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:27.95,0:01:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,With this, I won't be caught again! {??????}{又だ捕まるんじゃんかよ}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.53,0:01:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Thief! Thief! Stop, you!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.50,0:01:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What a persistent woman!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.22,0:01:47.18,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's awful.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.64,0:01:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.58,0:01:54.87,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Look, he's right there behind the tree!\NAh, she didn't notice! {影 can also mean behind}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.36,0:02:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know she'll come back here.\NSasano Sato, please handle her. {??????}{又又引き返してしましたね}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.75,0:02:15.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you there! Do you know which way the thief went?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:15.64,0:02:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.50,0:02:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He went over there.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:18.65,0:02:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I see!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.50,0:02:22.67,Narrator,,0,0,0,,My, he's so useful. {lit: why, it's convenient}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:23.34,0:02:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Small is our house, \Nbut we love it the way it is...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.59,0:02:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, now that I think about it, being popular with women is one of the things I'm not.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.19,0:02:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But with this item, even I can get myself a beautiful woman who will obey me without question.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:43.52,0:02:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,With jet black hair like a crow. {that's a thing apparently}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.46,0:02:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, please love me, won't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.22,0:02:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Won't you?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.01,0:02:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If I kissed you...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.86,0:02:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd turn into a pumpkin. {???????? maybe something to do with "man with an unattractive, unusually shaped face"}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.74,0:02:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! I've done turned her into a pumpkin!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.35,0:02:56.85,Overlap,,0,0,0,,Hey, was it you who drew me like this?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.85,0:02:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's try another!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.50,0:03:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, love me.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.20,0:03:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, when I think about it, \NI've been terrible at drawing since elementary school. {lit: last on the list}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.75,0:03:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{???}{most likely nonsense to reflect her nonsense appearance }
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that a Picasso?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.29,0:03:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He's over there. {repeat of his last line}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.50,0:03:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,There, there! Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.87,0:03:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, next one, go!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.71,0:03:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Love me... {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.80,0:03:28.53,Overlap,,0,0,0,,A ghost!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.89,0:03:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.15,0:03:32.66,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a disaster!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.64,0:03:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, next!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.70,0:03:44.02,Narrator,,0,0,0,,That thief still keeps churning out more!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.02,0:03:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Here goes another one!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.09,0:03:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, next!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.29,0:03:50.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.51,0:03:52.18,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ah, how creepy!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:56.60,0:03:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my crowd-pleaser mode. {?????????????????????????????????????????????????????????????} {あたりモード maybe, idk}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.11,0:04:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, can I have that?{???????????}{I can only hear それをくれよ at the end}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.20,0:04:06.38,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Goodness, there're even women he crossed off walking around!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.24,0:04:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, next one!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.21,0:04:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Next one!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.36,0:04:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.97,0:04:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Help me, somebody!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.85,0:04:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, next!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.95,0:04:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still drawing them! {????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.86,0:04:48.42,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Gosh, now that's just kindergarten stuff!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.42,0:04:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Another one!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.87,0:05:07.79,Narrator,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the village will be filled with women from scrapped drawings! {???}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.54,0:05:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Hey, those are my legs!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.65,0:06:19.68,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And so, the Hermit Village \Nquickly turned into a Ghost Village.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.89,0:06:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, it's all because of that pencil.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.58,0:06:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,So you were naked, taking a bath?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:29.77,0:06:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.35,0:06:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And he sneaked up on you from behind?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.56,0:06:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I've got just the right tool against that...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.71,0:06:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, look at this.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.43,0:06:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it. The eraser for a case just like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.03,0:06:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{?? probably just a spell?}{SHUWATCH!}{hahaha, just made you waste 0.2 seconds of your life reading an useless comment. Despair over the fact I have made it worse - Paul}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.06,0:06:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start erasing.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.74,0:06:54.21,Narrator,,0,0,0,,But will this really bring peace \Nto the Hermit Village? {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.21,0:06:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.46,0:06:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No good!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.78,0:07:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's hot today... {honestly I think she's just talking more nonsense here, you should delete this line before sending it to sotoo. No I do not think I will. - Paul}{hot tbh}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.09,0:07:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.38,0:07:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm... That's a real shame. {meaning "to erase a woman like that"}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.35,0:07:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, whatever. \NLet's erase it. {BASED WOMEN ANNIHILATOR!}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:22.39,0:07:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.47,0:07:27.52,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Oh, my? Right, that woman is a real one! {/real thing}{I mean, she technically is just as drawn as the other ones}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.40,0:07:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice weather today!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.96,0:07:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.55,0:07:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm real happy!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.98,0:07:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.32,0:07:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.50,0:07:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.61,0:07:50.43,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Ah, it creeps me out!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.43,0:07:51.79,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and erase them!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.13,0:08:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,In this case, I have no choice \Nbut to copy Bardot-chan from her photo. {https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brigitte_Bardot}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.84,0:08:06.52,Narrator,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, the thief is still busy \Nproducing more of his masterpieces.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.08,0:08:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're a spitting image of B.B. \Nif I do say so myself! {again Brigitte Bardot}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.75,0:08:16.52,Narrator,,0,0,0,,What he ended up with was a stunning Parisian.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.13,0:08:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Bonjour, Monsieur.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.13,0:08:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Comme ci, comme ça. {????? believing chatgpt, supposedly this means "not too bad, not too good"}{KILL YOURSELF!}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.16,0:08:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.05,0:08:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{???? maybe something in french too?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.00,0:08:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You look awfully ugly and scruffy—\Nthe kind of man I hate!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.85,0:08:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dior, Cardin, and Paris Mode. {Paris fashion}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.13,0:08:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a Parisian.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.16,0:08:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're gorgeousian!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.39,0:08:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, another accessory.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.37,0:08:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Seiwa Tsubaki the 46th. {?????????? sounds like he's talking with accent so probably just cobbling together typical samurai words?}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.46,0:09:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Samurai, harakiri! So lovely!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.99,0:09:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa there! A-Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.97,0:09:08.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my woman!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.97,0:09:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.29,0:09:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's not fair! {????????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.71,0:09:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we go?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.85,0:09:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oui, Monsieur.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.02,0:09:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.26,0:09:24.55,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.11,0:09:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... Tantalizing.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.37,0:09:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But you did it so fast \NI didn't even understand what happened!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.87,0:09:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's watch it in slow-motion. {lit: on the video tape}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.32,0:09:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? Part of your sword has disappeared.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.50,0:09:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I need to switch things up, it seems. {???????????}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.12,0:09:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If drawing women is hopeless, \NI can draw the means to get them. {??????????????????}{more like "If I can't draw women, I'll have to draw the means to get them"}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.23,0:09:58.27,Narrator,,0,0,0,,After getting dumped by B.B., \Nthe thief gave reign to his greed.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.27,0:10:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a real 10,000 yen bill! {??????}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.52,0:10:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Not bad at all!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.20,0:10:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's erase, let's erase, let's erase.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.06,0:10:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.95,0:10:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's erase, let's erase
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.45,0:10:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You! H-Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.52,0:10:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.40,0:10:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.65,0:10:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! You little!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.52,0:10:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Hey! Wait, I said! Hey! Stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.26,0:10:32.00,Narrator,,0,0,0,,And it led the thief to the police station.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.68,0:10:39.98,Narrator,,0,0,0,,While the other eraser half cleaned up the rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.50,0:10:43.51,Narrator,,0,0,0,,What about the pencil?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.82,0:10:51.18,Narrator,,0,0,0,,My, what an adorable child!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.52,0:11:06.19,Narrator,,0,0,0,,The moral of the story \Nis that it wasn't the pencil
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.19,0:11:09.90,Narrator,,0,0,0,,that was the problem—\Nit all depends on the person using it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.90,0:11:11.79,Narrator,,0,0,0,,That's true for women too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:50.90,Sign,,0,0,0,,{=1=2}{\blur2\c&HAAAAAA&\fnAkbar\frz12.77\fscx81\fscy100\pos(1189.61,71.44)}Hermit Village
